<title>GERMANY: HENKEL DETAILS H1 97 FIGURES.</title>
<headline>HENKEL DETAILS H1 97 FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     438     vs 397</p>
<p>    Group sales				  9,784   vs 8,039</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Chemicals				   2,373   vs 2,086</p>
<p>     Surface technologies		    795     vs 512</p>
<p>Industrial adhesives/</p>
<p>     technical consumer products	   2,086   vs 1,239</p>
<p>     Cosmetics/toiletries		    1,449   vs 1,314</p>
<p>     Detergents/household cleansers	2,275   vs 2,105</p>
<p>     Hygiene products			  725     vs 694</p>
<p>     Other activities			  81	vs 89</p>
<p>Sales by region</p>
<p>     Domestic				    2,281 vs 2,264</p>
<p>     Exported				    548     vs 503</p>
<p>     Foreign units			     6,955   vs 5,272</p>
<p>    No of employees			    52,145  vs 46,665</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Domestic				    15,461  vs 15,715</p>
<p>     Foreign				     36,648  vs 30,950</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German speciality chemicals group is Henkel KGaA. The payroll figure compares employee numbers at the end of June 1997 with the figure at the end of December 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
